# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and runtime data — MUST NEVER be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# FTP credentials for the live host. deploy/ftp-deploy.ps1 reads a "Pass=" line
# from this file when one is present, so it can and does hold a real password.
# deploy/ftp.config.example is the tracked template.
deploy/ftp.config

# Admin password hash, submitted enquiries (names, emails, phones, IPs),
# login-throttle state and analytics. This folder lives OUTSIDE the web root on
# the server and has no business in version control.
private/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only dev material — never belongs in the live docroot.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
README.md
docs/
deploy/
.claude/
.impeccable/
.archive/
Share Folder/
products/
Deploy.cmd
Deploy-Preview.cmd

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Host-owned / admin-mutable — a git pull must NEVER touch these. The admin
# panel writes here directly; a fresh clone must not create or overwrite them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
assets/data/

assets/img/*
!assets/img/ergotrade-logo.png
!assets/img/logo-kapriol.svg
!assets/img/favicon.ico
!assets/img/favicon-16.png
!assets/img/favicon-32.png
!assets/img/apple-touch-icon.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.bak
